    "chunk_text": "lcum men, & he w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e ge\u00feyldig, & ea\u00f0mod, & & \u00f0eah \u00fee he \u00fea gyt on l\u00e6wedum hade beon sceolde, hwe\u00f0re he to\u00f0on w\u00e6rnesse h\u00e6fde on eallum W\u00e6s he for his arf\u00e6stum d\u00e6dum eallum his geferum leof & weor\u00f0 & ondrysne, & hie hine ealle & \u00f0eah he \u00fea gyt n\u00e6re fullice \u00e6fter o\u00feerre endebyrdnesse gefulwad, ah he w\u00e6s gecristnod, swa ic \u00e6r He wolde \u00fe\u00e6m winnendum fultmian, & earme frefran, & hingrigendum mete syllan, & nacode scrydan, Gemunde he \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten bebead on \u00fe\u00e6m godspelle, de crastino non cogitare, \u00fe\u00e6t se Godes man ne Magon we nu \u00feara arf\u00e6stra d\u00e6da sume gehyran s\u00e6cgan \u00fee he \u00fees eadiga wer, Sanctus Martinus, sona \u00d0\u00e6t gelamp sume si\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t he ferde mid o\u00ferum cininges \u00f0egnum on \u00f0a burg \u00fee Ambinensus hatte; \u00fe\u00e6t W\u00e6s se winter eac \u00fey geare to\u00fe\u00e6s grim \u00fe\u00e6t manig man his feorh for cyle gesealde. \u00dea s\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r sum \u00feearfa \u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6m burggeate, s\u00e6t eac nacod, b\u00e6d him \u00fea for Gode hr\u00e6gles & \u00e6lmessan. \u00dea ferdan hie ealle for\u00f0 be him & heora n\u00e6nig him to cerran nolde, ne him n\u00e6nigre are gedon. \u00d0a ongeat se Godes wer Sanctus Martinus \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten him \u00f0one \u00feearfan geheold, \u00fe\u00e6t he him miltsian Nyste \u00feeah hwe\u00f0re hw\u00e6t he him don sceolde,",
